Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:03.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}What if the internet disappeared overnight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.64,0:00:06.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You wake at three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.36,0:00:07.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.72,0:00:09.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}No messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.15,0:00:10.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}No news.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Just a dead black slab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:13.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.69,0:00:16.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.22,0:00:18.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Cities go quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.10,0:00:20.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The cloud goes dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.01,0:00:22.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.65,0:00:24.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Cash only.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.14,0:00:26.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}You queue for bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.80,0:00:28.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:30.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Empty shelves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:32.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Neighbours share food.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:34.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}After one month.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.78,0:00:37.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Children play outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.77,0:00:39.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}But here's the twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.76,0:00:42.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The internet is not in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.15,0:00:44.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}It lies on the ocean floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.44,0:00:47.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}One and a half million kilometers of cable.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.51,0:00:51.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}In two thousand eight, two were cut near Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:53.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Egypt lost seventy percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.95,0:00:56.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}India, sixty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:01:00.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}A woman with a spade took a country offline.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.05,0:01:01.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}So remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.41,0:01:04.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}The cloud is a glass floor on the ocean floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.88,0:01:06.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Would you still trust it?
